Package: sqrt-gem
Version: 1.0.0
Section: math
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: SQRT_Gem Team <info@example.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyside6 | libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: libgl1-mesa-glx, libegl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libdbus-1-3
Homepage: https://github.com/yatoz0r/SQRT_Gem
Description: High-precision analytical math calculator
 SQRT_Gem is an arbitrary-precision desktop calculator built with Python
 and PySide6 (Qt). It supports arbitrary precision arithmetic up to 1000+
 decimal places, transcendental functions, 4 languages (RU, EN, ES, ZH),
 and integrated self-diagnostic center.
